{{!-- A Layout override (ADR 0006): the author Surface in the List layout whatever
`feed_layout` says. Inert until a routes.yaml entry names it as a template; author.hbs follows
the setting. Name it from a `controller: channel` route with
`data: author.{slug}`, which supplies the `author`; a channel with `data:` redirects that Author's
own URL to itself. Not `author-{layout}.hbs`: Ghost would resolve that for an Author whose slug
is the layout's name. --}}

{{> "chrome/header"}}

<main
	id="main"
	class="grow"
	data-surface="author"
	data-layout="List">

	{{> "author/surface" layout="List"}}

</main>

{{> "chrome/footer"}}
